@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_DE_LOGIN
@cliente = 3
@lote = 3

### Estado
GET {{base}}/health

### Iniciar sesión demo
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"asesor@casavip.pe","password":"CasaVIP-demo-2026!"}

### Catálogo autorizado
GET {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lotes disponibles
GET {{base}}/lots?project=1&state=DISPONIBLE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente ficticio, solo para base demo
POST {{base}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Cliente de prueba","tipo_documento":"DNI","numero_documento":"00000888","telefono":"900000888","correo":"prueba@example.test","proyecto_id":1}

### Confirmar separación (ajustar ids a la respuesta real)
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lote_id":{{lote}},"cliente_id":{{cliente}},"monto":500,"observacion":"Demostracion academica"}

### Consultar separaciones
GET {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial
GET {{base}}/lots/{{lote}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
